      "solution": {
        "status": "confirmed",
        "reasoning": "Option d shows opposite rays and a shaded semicircle, representing a straight angle of 180°. Option a is a right angle, b is reflex, c depicts a full turn, and e shows coincident rays from O. No Math Academy key or grade for this question is captured; the worked solution concerns a different example.",
