      "solution": {
        "status": "confirmed",
        "reasoning": "Option a shades a complete circle around O with coincident rays OB and OC, representing a full angle of 360°. Option b is acute, c is obtuse, d is right, and e is straight. No Math Academy key or grade for this question is captured; the worked solution concerns a different example.",
