      "solution": {
        "status": "confirmed",
        "reasoning": "The vertex of ∠VOW is O. V and W lie in the same direction from O, so rays OV and OW coincide. The angle is null (0°) or full (360°), depending on the turn, matching option a. The supplied example supports this interpretation but does not establish Math Academy's key for this question.",
