      {
        "dom_id": "step-40055",
        "name": "Example: \n                    Identifying Straight Angles",
        "problem": "Which of the following shows a straight angle?\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14131901/assets/e6ee9f2a0b7dfa70c1d61dac0d19e1347d56ba94d93762c435d0727216d61143.png)",
        "worked_solution": "A straight angle has a degree measure of $180^\\circ.$ This corresponds to one-half of a full turn.\n\nAmong the given options, the only straight angle is the following:\n\n \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14131901/assets/1e16add703d800bce68d70ded10f220808accb557ae15f9245147eaf3ca513b1.png)\n\n \n\nTherefore, the correct answer is III.",
        "calculator_instructions": "",
