    "lesson_definition": {
      "topic_id": "1509",
      "title": "Right, Straight, Full, and Null Angles",
      "steps": [
        {
          "math_academy_id": 8748,
          "type": "tutorial",
          "content_id": 2178,
          "title": "Introduction",
          "position": 0,
          "dom_id": "step-8748",
          "html": "<div class=\"step\" contentid=\"2178\" id=\"step-8748\" stepid=\"8748\" steptype=\"tutorial\" style=\"display: block\">\n<div class=\"stepHeader\">\n<div class=\"stepName\">\n<a class=\"stepAnchor\" id=\"stepAnchor-8748\" name=\"step-1\">Introduction</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"8748\">?</div>\n</div>\n<style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n                            -webkit-transition: none;\n                            -moz-transition: none;\n                            -ms-transition: none;\n                            -o-transition: none\n                            }\n\n                            .mjx-svg-href {\n                            fill: blue;\n                            stroke: blue\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox {\n                            display: table!important\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox span {\n                            display: table-cell!important;\n                            width: 10000em!important;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage__block {\n                            text-align: center;\n                            margin: 1em 0em;\n                            position: relative;\n                            display: block!important;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            width: 100%\n                            }</style><p>Some angles have special names.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>A <strong>right angle</strong> has a measure of <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.176ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -791.3 1733.4 936.9\" width=\"4.026ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">90^\\circ.</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M352 287Q304 211 232 211Q154 211 104 270T44 396Q42 412 42 436V444Q42 537 111 606Q171 666 243 666Q245 666 249 666T257 665H261Q273 665 286 663T323 651T370 619T413 560Q456 472 456 334Q456 194 396 97Q361 41 312 10T208 -22Q147 -22 108 7T68 93T121 149Q143 149 158 135T173 96Q173 78 164 65T148 49T135 44L131 43Q131 41 138 37T164 27T206 22H212Q272 22 313 86Q352 142 352 280V287ZM244 248Q292 248 321 297T351 430Q351 508 343 542Q341 552 337 562T323 588T293 615T246 625Q208 625 181 598Q160 576 154 546T147 441Q147 358 152 329T172 282Q197 248 244 248Z\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-39\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M96 585Q152 666 249 666Q297 666 345 640T423 548Q460 465 460 320Q460 165 417 83Q397 41 362 16T301 -15T250 -22Q224 -22 198 -16T137 16T82 83Q39 165 39 320Q39 494 96 585ZM321 597Q291 629 250 629Q208 629 178 597Q153 571 145 525T137 333Q137 175 145 125T181 46Q209 16 250 16Q290 16 318 46Q347 76 354 130T362 333Q362 478 354 524T321 597Z\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-30\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M55 251Q55 328 112 386T249 444T386 388T444 249Q444 171 388 113T250 55Q170 55 113 112T55 251ZM245 403Q188 403 142 361T96 250Q96 183 141 140T250 96Q284 96 313 109T354 135T375 160Q403 197 403 250Q403 313 360 358T245 403Z\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-2218\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-2E\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-39\"></use>\n<use x=\"500\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-30\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" x=\"1415\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2218\" y=\"557\"></use>\n<use x=\"1454\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2E\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> It corresponds to one-quarter of a full turn.</p>\n<div class=\"graphic\" id=\"graphic-0729ecdd0e50e50ae481185840af19a7\"><img src=\"/graphics/0729ecdd0e50e50ae481185840af19a7\"/></div>\n</li>\n<li><p>A <strong>straight angle</strong>, which is just a straight line, has a measure of <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.176ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -791.3 2233.9 936.9\" width=\"5.188ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">180^\\circ.</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M213 578L200 573Q186 568 160 563T102 556H83V602H102Q149 604 189 617T245 641T273 663Q275 666 285 666Q294 666 302 660V361L303 61Q310 54 315 52T339 48T401 46H427V0H416Q395 3 257 3Q121 3 100 0H88V46H114Q136 46 152 46T177 47T193 50T201 52T207 57T213 61V578Z\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-31\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M70 417T70 494T124 618T248 666Q319 666 374 624T429 515Q429 485 418 459T392 417T361 389T335 371T324 363L338 354Q352 344 366 334T382 323Q457 264 457 174Q457 95 399 37T249 -22Q159 -22 101 29T43 155Q43 263 172 335L154 348Q133 361 127 368Q70 417 70 494ZM286 386L292 390Q298 394 301 396T311 403T323 413T334 425T345 438T355 454T364 471T369 491T371 513Q371 556 342 586T275 624Q268 625 242 625Q201 625 165 599T128 534Q128 511 141 492T167 463T217 431Q224 426 228 424L286 386ZM250 21Q308 21 350 55T392 137Q392 154 387 169T375 194T353 216T330 234T301 253T274 270Q260 279 244 289T218 306L210 311Q204 311 181 294T133 239T107 157Q107 98 150 60T250 21Z\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-38\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M96 585Q152 666 249 666Q297 666 345 640T423 548Q460 465 460 320Q460 165 417 83Q397 41 362 16T301 -15T250 -22Q224 -22 198 -16T137 16T82 83Q39 165 39 320Q39 494 96 585ZM321 597Q291 629 250 629Q208 629 178 597Q153 571 145 525T137 333Q137 175 145 125T181 46Q209 16 250 16Q290 16 318 46Q347 76 354 130T362 333Q362 478 354 524T321 597Z\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-30\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M55 251Q55 328 112 386T249 444T386 388T444 249Q444 171 388 113T250 55Q170 55 113 112T55 251ZM245 403Q188 403 142 361T96 250Q96 183 141 140T250 96Q284 96 313 109T354 135T375 160Q403 197 403 250Q403 313 360 358T245 403Z\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-2218\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-2E\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-31\"></use>\n<use x=\"500\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-38\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"1001\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-30\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" x=\"2123\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-2218\" y=\"557\"></use>\n<use x=\"1955\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-2E\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> It corresponds to one-half of a full turn.</p>\n<div class=\"graphic\" id=\"graphic-cc5d4e4f0eebd08cb156839b6e212a3c\"><img src=\"/graphics/cc5d4e4f0eebd08cb156839b6e212a3c\"/></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><p>A <strong>null angle</strong> has a measure of <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.176ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -791.3 1232.9 936.9\" width=\"2.864ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">0^\\circ.</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M96 585Q152 666 249 666Q297 666 345 640T423 548Q460 465 460 320Q460 165 417 83Q397 41 362 16T301 -15T250 -22Q224 -22 198 -16T137 16T82 83Q39 165 39 320Q39 494 96 585ZM321 597Q291 629 250 629Q208 629 178 597Q153 571 145 525T137 333Q137 175 145 125T181 46Q209 16 250 16Q290 16 318 46Q347 76 354 130T362 333Q362 478 354 524T321 597Z\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-30\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M55 251Q55 328 112 386T249 444T386 388T444 249Q444 171 388 113T250 55Q170 55 113 112T55 251ZM245 403Q188 403 142 361T96 250Q96 183 141 140T250 96Q284 96 313 109T354 135T375 160Q403 197 403 250Q403 313 360 358T245 403Z\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-2218\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-2E\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-30\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" x=\"707\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-2218\" y=\"557\"></use>\n<use x=\"954\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-2E\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> You can imagine \"closing\" the angle until the two sides of the angle overlap. In this case, we don't have any turn, so its measure is zero!</p>\n<div class=\"graphic\" id=\"graphic-d2a63c2f2b942f09af2cd7367e0505a0\"><img src=\"/graphics/d2a63c2f2b942f09af2cd7367e0505a0\"/></div>\n</li>\n<li><p>A <strong>full angle</strong> has a measure of <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.176ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -791.3 2233.9 936.9\" width=\"5.188ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">360^\\circ.</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M127 463Q100 463 85 480T69 524Q69 579 117 622T233 665Q268 665 277 664Q351 652 390 611T430 522Q430 470 396 421T302 350L299 348Q299 347 308 345T337 336T375 315Q457 262 457 175Q457 96 395 37T238 -22Q158 -22 100 21T42 130Q42 158 60 175T105 193Q133 193 151 175T169 130Q169 119 166 110T159 94T148 82T136 74T126 70T118 67L114 66Q165 21 238 21Q293 21 321 74Q338 107 338 175V195Q338 290 274 322Q259 328 213 329L171 330L168 332Q166 335 166 348Q166 366 174 366Q202 366 232 371Q266 376 294 413T322 525V533Q322 590 287 612Q265 626 240 626Q208 626 181 615T143 592T132 580H135Q138 579 143 578T153 573T165 566T175 555T183 540T186 520Q186 498 172 481T127 463Z\" id=\"E4-MJMAIN-33\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M42 313Q42 476 123 571T303 666Q372 666 402 630T432 550Q432 525 418 510T379 495Q356 495 341 509T326 548Q326 592 373 601Q351 623 311 626Q240 626 194 566Q147 500 147 364L148 360Q153 366 156 373Q197 433 263 433H267Q313 433 348 414Q372 400 396 374T435 317Q456 268 456 210V192Q456 169 451 149Q440 90 387 34T253 -22Q225 -22 199 -14T143 16T92 75T56 172T42 313ZM257 397Q227 397 205 380T171 335T154 278T148 216Q148 133 160 97T198 39Q222 21 251 21Q302 21 329 59Q342 77 347 104T352 209Q352 289 347 316T329 361Q302 397 257 397Z\" id=\"E4-MJMAIN-36\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M96 585Q152 666 249 666Q297 666 345 640T423 548Q460 465 460 320Q460 165 417 83Q397 41 362 16T301 -15T250 -22Q224 -22 198 -16T137 16T82 83Q39 165 39 320Q39 494 96 585ZM321 597Q291 629 250 629Q208 629 178 597Q153 571 145 525T137 333Q137 175 145 125T181 46Q209 16 250 16Q290 16 318 46Q347 76 354 130T362 333Q362 478 354 524T321 597Z\" id=\"E4-MJMAIN-30\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M55 251Q55 328 112 386T249 444T386 388T444 249Q444 171 388 113T250 55Q170 55 113 112T55 251ZM245 403Q188 403 142 361T96 250Q96 183 141 140T250 96Q284 96 313 109T354 135T375 160Q403 197 403 250Q403 313 360 358T245 403Z\" id=\"E4-MJMAIN-2218\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\" id=\"E4-MJMAIN-2E\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use xlink:href=\"#E4-MJMAIN-33\"></use>\n<use x=\"500\" xlink:href=\"#E4-MJMAIN-36\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"1001\" xlink:href=\"#E4-MJMAIN-30\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" x=\"2123\" xlink:href=\"#E4-MJMAIN-2218\" y=\"557\"></use>\n<use x=\"1955\" xlink:href=\"#E4-MJMAIN-2E\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> You can imagine \"opening\" the angle until one of the sides goes all the way around. So, this is the angle between a ray and itself after it has made one full turn.</p>\n<div class=\"graphic\" id=\"graphic-7ba2fb4b247374848dbc4b7c8d7fcf85\"><img src=\"/graphics/7ba2fb4b247374848dbc4b7c8d7fcf85\"/></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>On a diagram, null and full angles can look the same, so it is up to us what we choose to call it.</p>\n</div>"
        },
        {
          "math_academy_id": 40054,
          "type": "example",
          "content_id": 10595,
          "title": "Identifying Right Angles",
          "position": 1,
          "dom_id": "step-40054",
          "html": "<div class=\"step\" contentid=\"10595\" id=\"step-40054\" stepid=\"40054\" steptype=\"example\" style=\"display: block\">\n<div class=\"stepHeader\">\n<div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a class=\"stepAnchor\" id=\"stepAnchor-40054\" name=\"step-2\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Identifying Right Angles</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"40054\">?</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n<p>Which of the following shows a right angle?</p>\n<div class=\"graphic\" id=\"graphic-8e5c550bebeadc1d031c5f38ade12467\"><img src=\"/graphics/8e5c550bebeadc1d031c5f38ade12467\"/></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"explanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div>\n<div class=\"exampleExplanation\">\n<style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n                            -webkit-transition: none;\n                            -moz-transition: none;\n                            -ms-transition: none;\n                            -o-transition: none\n                            }\n\n                            .mjx-svg-href {\n                            fill: blue;\n                            stroke: blue\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox {\n                            display: table!important\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox span {\n                            display: table-cell!important;\n                            width: 10000em!important;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage__block {\n                            text-align: center;\n                            margin: 1em 0em;\n                            position: relative;\n                            display: block!important;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            width: 100%\n                            }</style><p>An angle of <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.176ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -791.3 1454.9 936.9\" width=\"3.379ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">90^\\circ</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M352 287Q304 211 232 211Q154 211 104 270T44 396Q42 412 42 436V444Q42 537 111 606Q171 666 243 666Q245 666 249 666T257 665H261Q273 665 286 663T323 651T370 619T413 560Q456 472 456 334Q456 194 396 97Q361 41 312 10T208 -22Q147 -22 108 7T68 93T121 149Q143 149 158 135T173 96Q173 78 164 65T148 49T135 44L131 43Q131 41 138 37T164 27T206 22H212Q272 22 313 86Q352 142 352 280V287ZM244 248Q292 248 321 297T351 430Q351 508 343 542Q341 552 337 562T323 588T293 615T246 625Q208 625 181 598Q160 576 154 546T147 441Q147 358 152 329T172 282Q197 248 244 248Z\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-39\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M96 585Q152 666 249 666Q297 666 345 640T423 548Q460 465 460 320Q460 165 417 83Q397 41 362 16T301 -15T250 -22Q224 -22 198 -16T137 16T82 83Q39 165 39 320Q39 494 96 585ZM321 597Q291 629 250 629Q208 629 178 597Q153 571 145 525T137 333Q137 175 145 125T181 46Q209 16 250 16Q290 16 318 46Q347 76 354 130T362 333Q362 478 354 524T321 597Z\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-30\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M55 251Q55 328 112 386T249 444T386 388T444 249Q444 171 388 113T250 55Q170 55 113 112T55 251ZM245 403Q188 403 142 361T96 250Q96 183 141 140T250 96Q284 96 313 109T354 135T375 160Q403 197 403 250Q403 313 360 358T245 403Z\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-2218\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-39\"></use>\n<use x=\"500\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-30\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" x=\"1415\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2218\" y=\"557\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> has the same measure as one-quarter of a full turn.</p>\n<p>Among the given options, the only <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.176ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -791.3 1454.9 936.9\" width=\"3.379ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">90^\\circ</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M352 287Q304 211 232 211Q154 211 104 270T44 396Q42 412 42 436V444Q42 537 111 606Q171 666 243 666Q245 666 249 666T257 665H261Q273 665 286 663T323 651T370 619T413 560Q456 472 456 334Q456 194 396 97Q361 41 312 10T208 -22Q147 -22 108 7T68 93T121 149Q143 149 158 135T173 96Q173 78 164 65T148 49T135 44L131 43Q131 41 138 37T164 27T206 22H212Q272 22 313 86Q352 142 352 280V287ZM244 248Q292 248 321 297T351 430Q351 508 343 542Q341 552 337 562T323 588T293 615T246 625Q208 625 181 598Q160 576 154 546T147 441Q147 358 152 329T172 282Q197 248 244 248Z\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-39\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M96 585Q152 666 249 666Q297 666 345 640T423 548Q460 465 460 320Q460 165 417 83Q397 41 362 16T301 -15T250 -22Q224 -22 198 -16T137 16T82 83Q39 165 39 320Q39 494 96 585ZM321 597Q291 629 250 629Q208 629 178 597Q153 571 145 525T137 333Q137 175 145 125T181 46Q209 16 250 16Q290 16 318 46Q347 76 354 130T362 333Q362 478 354 524T321 597Z\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-30\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M55 251Q55 328 112 386T249 444T386 388T444 249Q444 171 388 113T250 55Q170 55 113 112T55 251ZM245 403Q188 403 142 361T96 250Q96 183 141 140T250 96Q284 96 313 109T354 135T375 160Q403 197 403 250Q403 313 360 358T245 403Z\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-2218\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-39\"></use>\n<use x=\"500\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-30\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" x=\"1415\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-2218\" y=\"557\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> angle is the following:</p>\n<div class=\"graphic\" id=\"graphic-7578182bd3234b7f3193dc04c1d11677\"><img src=\"/graphics/7578182bd3234b7f3193dc04c1d11677\"/></div>\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is II.</p>\n</div>\n</div>"
        },
        {
          "math_academy_id": 40055,
          "type": "example",
          "content_id": 10596,
          "title": "Identifying Straight Angles",
          "position": 2,
          "dom_id": "step-40055",
          "html": "<div class=\"step\" contentid=\"10596\" id=\"step-40055\" stepid=\"40055\" steptype=\"example\" style=\"display: block\">\n<div class=\"stepHeader\">\n<div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a class=\"stepAnchor\" id=\"stepAnchor-40055\" name=\"step-6\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Identifying Straight Angles</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"40055\">?</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n<p>Which of the following shows a straight angle?</p>\n<div class=\"graphic\" id=\"graphic-e5163da52d7b58149b9070a20d12b6f2\"><img src=\"/graphics/e5163da52d7b58149b9070a20d12b6f2\"/></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"explanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div>\n<div class=\"exampleExplanation\">\n<style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n                            -webkit-transition: none;\n                            -moz-transition: none;\n                            -ms-transition: none;\n                            -o-transition: none\n                            }\n\n                            .mjx-svg-href {\n                            fill: blue;\n                            stroke: blue\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox {\n                            display: table!important\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox span {\n                            display: table-cell!important;\n                            width: 10000em!important;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage__block {\n                            text-align: center;\n                            margin: 1em 0em;\n                            position: relative;\n                            display: block!important;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            width: 100%\n                            }</style><p>A straight angle has a degree measure of <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.176ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -791.3 2233.9 936.9\" width=\"5.188ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">180^\\circ.</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M213 578L200 573Q186 568 160 563T102 556H83V602H102Q149 604 189 617T245 641T273 663Q275 666 285 666Q294 666 302 660V361L303 61Q310 54 315 52T339 48T401 46H427V0H416Q395 3 257 3Q121 3 100 0H88V46H114Q136 46 152 46T177 47T193 50T201 52T207 57T213 61V578Z\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-31\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M70 417T70 494T124 618T248 666Q319 666 374 624T429 515Q429 485 418 459T392 417T361 389T335 371T324 363L338 354Q352 344 366 334T382 323Q457 264 457 174Q457 95 399 37T249 -22Q159 -22 101 29T43 155Q43 263 172 335L154 348Q133 361 127 368Q70 417 70 494ZM286 386L292 390Q298 394 301 396T311 403T323 413T334 425T345 438T355 454T364 471T369 491T371 513Q371 556 342 586T275 624Q268 625 242 625Q201 625 165 599T128 534Q128 511 141 492T167 463T217 431Q224 426 228 424L286 386ZM250 21Q308 21 350 55T392 137Q392 154 387 169T375 194T353 216T330 234T301 253T274 270Q260 279 244 289T218 306L210 311Q204 311 181 294T133 239T107 157Q107 98 150 60T250 21Z\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-38\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M96 585Q152 666 249 666Q297 666 345 640T423 548Q460 465 460 320Q460 165 417 83Q397 41 362 16T301 -15T250 -22Q224 -22 198 -16T137 16T82 83Q39 165 39 320Q39 494 96 585ZM321 597Q291 629 250 629Q208 629 178 597Q153 571 145 525T137 333Q137 175 145 125T181 46Q209 16 250 16Q290 16 318 46Q347 76 354 130T362 333Q362 478 354 524T321 597Z\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-30\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M55 251Q55 328 112 386T249 444T386 388T444 249Q444 171 388 113T250 55Q170 55 113 112T55 251ZM245 403Q188 403 142 361T96 250Q96 183 141 140T250 96Q284 96 313 109T354 135T375 160Q403 197 403 250Q403 313 360 358T245 403Z\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-2218\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-2E\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-31\"></use>\n<use x=\"500\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-38\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"1001\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-30\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" x=\"2123\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2218\" y=\"557\"></use>\n<use x=\"1955\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2E\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> This corresponds to one-half of a full turn.</p>\n<p>Among the given options, the only straight angle is the following:</p>\n<div class=\"graphic\" id=\"graphic-6260b2316837acff1bc4931cb5d81561\"><img src=\"/graphics/6260b2316837acff1bc4931cb5d81561\"/></div>\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is III.</p>\n</div>\n</div>"
        },
